dune passes the ppx a `library-name` cookie. The ppx writes it into each
module's `[@@@css.config]`, and `generate` lists the distinct library names
of its inputs, sorted, on the sheet's first line. Here one rule covers two
libraries, `ui` and `ui_native`; `ui` is listed although it sorts second
in the path order of the inputs.

  $ cat > dune-project << EOF
  > (lang dune 3.16)
  > EOF

  $ mkdir -p shared native
  $ cat > shared/button.re << EOF
  > let button = [%css "color: red"];
  > EOF
  $ cat > native/card.re << EOF
  > let card = [%css "color: blue"];
  > EOF

  $ cat > shared/dune << EOF
  > (library
  >  (name ui)
  >  (libraries styled-ppx.native)
  >  (preprocess
  >   (pps styled-ppx --native)))
  > EOF
  $ cat > native/dune << EOF
  > (library
  >  (name ui_native)
  >  (libraries styled-ppx.native)
  >  (preprocess
  >   (pps styled-ppx --native)))
  > EOF
  $ cat > dune << EOF
  > (rule
  >  (target styles.css)
  >  (deps
  >   (glob_files native/*.pp.ml)
  >   (glob_files shared/*.pp.ml))
  >  (action
  >   (run styled-ppx.generate --output %{target} %{deps})))
  > EOF

  $ dune build styles.css
  $ cat _build/default/styles.css
  /* This file is generated by styled-ppx, do not edit manually; libraries: ui ui_native */
  .css-61krsva{color:blue;}
  .css-z4grbtg{color:red;}

The cookie is in the module's `[@@@css.config]`:

  $ dune describe pp shared/button.re | grep 'css.config'
  [@css.config [("library", "ui")]];

Without the cookie (the ppx run outside dune), the ppx writes no library
and the sheet lists none:

  $ cat > input.re << EOF
  > let title = [%css "color: green"];
  > EOF
  $ $(cd ../../../ppx/test && pwd)/standalone.exe --impl input.re -o input.ml
  $ grep 'css.config' input.ml
  [1]
  $ styled-ppx.generate input.ml
  /* This file is generated by styled-ppx, do not edit manually */
  .css-ivpc6js{color:green;}

A sheet whose inputs mix modules with and without a library lists the
libraries it knows:

  $ styled-ppx.generate input.ml _build/default/shared/button.re.pp.ml
  /* This file is generated by styled-ppx, do not edit manually; libraries: ui */
  .css-z4grbtg{color:red;}
  .css-ivpc6js{color:green;}
